      "originalText": "DELIVERY: at least once; event_id + schema_version + correlation_id. Inbox deduplicates local business writes.\nOutbox relay: 1s polling. Consumer failure: retry same topic / partition; 10th failure → <topic>.dlq.\nDLQ retained as a failure-handling example; no automatic redrive implemented.",
