      "index": "b0J",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.15,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "ONGOING STOCK CHANGES\nSeller Set/Adjust, reserve, commit, release and expiry → stock.changed → Catalog projection.\nInventory owns balances. Catalog accepts newer revisions; old events cannot overwrite fresh stock.",
      "roughness": 0,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2051309055,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "ONGOING STOCK CHANGES\nSeller Set/Adjust, reserve, commit, release and expiry → stock.changed → Catalog projection.\nInventory owns balances. Catalog accepts newer revisions; old events cannot overwrite fresh stock.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "updated": 1792190644379,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 60818289,
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "catalogflow-rules",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1890,
      "width": 1011.683349609375,
      "height": 92,
      "angle": 0,
      "autoResize": true,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "boundElements": [],
      "containerId": null,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "frameId": null,
      "groupIds": [],
      "index": "b0K",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.15,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "Products have no status; public reads exclude soft-deleted products (deletedAt).\nStock initialization is asynchronous; a missing projection does not hide the product. Inventory checks availability.\nDuplicate creation events never reset existing stock.\nSame seller/key + same payload → current product state, including edits / soft-delete; changed payload → conflict.",
      "roughness": 0,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 415868273,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "Products have no status; public reads exclude soft-deleted products (deletedAt).\nStock initialization is asynchronous; a missing projection does not hide the product. Inventory checks availability.\nDuplicate creation events never reset existing stock.\nSame seller/key + same payload → current product state, including edits / soft-delete; changed payload → conflict.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "updated": 1792190644379,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 149481503,
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "catalogflow-media",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2020,
      "width": 851.3833618164062,
      "height": 46,
      "angle": 0,
      "autoResize": true,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "boundElements": [],
      "containerId": null,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "fontFamily": 2,
