      "lineHeight": 1.15,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "Cancel allowed only for DRAFT / PENDING_PAYMENT; DRAFT needs no compensation.\nTerminal order status ≠ completed compensation. Release does not restock committed sales.\nInventory expiry: startup + every 60s; releases expired holds and emits stock.changed.\nExpiry does not fail Orders directly; Orders independently recovers / checks its deadline.",
      "roughness": 0,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 47344703,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "Cancel allowed only for DRAFT / PENDING_PAYMENT; DRAFT needs no compensation.\nTerminal order status ≠ completed compensation. Release does not restock committed sales.\nInventory expiry: startup + every 60s; releases expired holds and emits stock.changed.\nExpiry does not fail Orders directly; Orders independently recovers / checks its deadline.",
